# Normalize line endings. This repo is built and evaluated in a Linux
# container, so store (and check out) text files with LF regardless of the
# developer's OS or personal git config. This also silences the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep truly binary assets untouched (no line-ending conversion).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
